    <briefdescription>
<para>Addressing-only specifier for a single MUX control line. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>One <computeroutput><ref refid="structmux__control" kindref="compound">mux_control</ref></computeroutput> identifies a single output on a MUX controller. Its <computeroutput>cells</computeroutput> array carries only the addressing portion of a devicetree <computeroutput>mux-controls</computeroutput> specifier (no state cell). </para>
